<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2227_8417.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich willig dinnst, sambt waß wir ehren liebs
<lb n="2"/>und guotts vermögennd, zuovor, fromm fürsichtig ehrsam
<lb n="3"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Insonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethrüwe</unclear> liebe <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Aeltt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hüt</unclear> dato <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rathß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear> by ein andern fiertlver-
<lb n="5"/>samelt gwaren so ist vor unß erschinen <persName resp="#ner">Susane alt-
<lb n="6"/>manß</persName>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürbringen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ewaß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgloffenner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zitt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iro</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">flischlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bru</unclear>-
<lb n="8"/>der, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Todtwürdig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stoorben</unclear>. Und sy da <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">natürlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sige</unclear>, und unß fründtlich und under-
<lb n="10"/>theniglich gebätten und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angesucht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgschri</unclear>-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ben</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">A</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">L</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">A</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deße</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kenen</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abschlagen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergönstiget</unclear>, Inen zuo
<lb n="13"/>erfürdärung und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">behülfflich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> Inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erb</unclear>-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glüblichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gfahre</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> Inen dösy verlaßen mög
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mögen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">flüßen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Deßwegen</unclear> ist unser fründt-
<lb n="16"/>lich eidtgnößisch bitt und ersuchen, an üch alß
<lb n="17"/>unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">A</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">L</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">A</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landt</unclear>-
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">man</unclear> den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> darzuo ersucht und erbätten worden
<lb n="19"/>ist, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hannß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacob</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hielttiner</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethrüwen</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtsmääßen</unclear>, fründtlich und eidtgnößisch In disen
<lb n="21"/>erbgüttlin behülffen sin, und huld an sinigern
<lb n="22"/>helffen, wie unß nit zwifflet es beschehe
<lb n="23"/>daß wellend wir fründtlich und eydgnößisch
<lb n="24"/>umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">A</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">L</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">A</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschulden</unclear>
<lb n="25"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verdienen</unclear>. Hiemit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schirm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Goteß</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolbefehlende</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dh</unclear> <origDate when="1620" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">19</unclear> tag Augustÿ anno 1620</origDate>
<lb n="27"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-502" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Landamman und Rath
<lb n="28"/>zuo Glaruß</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2227_8418.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/>[]
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2227_8419.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2227_8420.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="30"/>Den frommen fuersichtig ehrsamen
<lb n="31"/>und wyßen, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Rath
<lb n="32"/>der Statt St. Gallen</orgName>, unsern inn=
<lb n="33"/>sonders gethrüwen lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alten</unclear> Eydt=
<lb n="34"/>gnoßen.
</p>
